Under other business:

Mike O’Donnell, City Attorney, reported on a petition filed with the City Clerk’s office
under the authority of State Statute §15-1-103(j) and inquired on how the governing body would
like to approach the matter.  Mayor Orr advised she believes it would be appropriate for the City
Attorney to investigate the matter and prepare a response with his findings.  Mr. O’Donnell
explained he will investigate the matter and prepare a memo.

There being no further business to come before the governing body, the meeting was
officially adjourned at 6:39 p.m.
